From 659b4547122259623c97fec0f949ccb53c57504e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eveeifyeve <open-source@eveeifyeve.dev>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:55:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Port to PCRE2

PCRE1 (libpcre 8.x) is end of life and distributions are dropping it.
Replace the dependency on Nim's std/re (which binds PCRE1 through
std/pcre) with nitely regex.
---
 .github/workflows/run-tests.yml  |  2 +-
 Dockerfile                       |  4 ++--
 README.md                        |  1 -
 config.nims                      |  7 ++++++
 nitter.nimble                    |  3 ++-
 src/experimental/parser/user.nim | 11 +++++----
 src/formatters.nim               | 39 ++++++++++++++++----------------
 src/parserutils.nim              | 11 +++++----
 src/routes/media.nim             | 11 +++++----
 9 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 38 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/run-tests.yml b/.github/workflows/run-tests.yml
index 33dcba5..cf19e2c 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/run-tests.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/run-tests.yml
@@ -73,7 +73,7 @@ jobs:
     steps:
       - name: Install runtime deps
         run: |
-          sudo apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends libsass-dev libpcre3
+          sudo apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends libsass-dev
 
       - name: Checkout code
         uses: actions/checkout@v6
